Confined compression across a nonconforming two-facet/one-facet interface
StaticStructural nsteps 20 deltat 0.05 renumber 0 nmodules 2 rtolv 1.e-9 stiffMode 0 manrmsteps 1 maxiter 100 initialguess 1 smtype 0
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 4 1 150 151 152
errorcheck
