lspace 1 nodes 8 1 2 5 4 7 8 11 10 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
lspace 2 nodes 8 2 3 6 5 8 9 12 11 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
lspace 3 nodes 8 13 14 15 16 17 18 19 20 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
StructuralContactElement_QuadLin 4 nodes 4 7 8 11 10 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralContactElement_QuadLin 5 nodes 4 8 9 12 11 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralContactElement_QuadLin 6 nodes 4 13 14 15 16 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 1 ce_set 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 2 ce_set 5
SimpleCS 1 material 1 set 6
DummyCS 2 mat 2
# Compressible Mooney-Rivlin surrogate using E=10000, nu=0.3-equivalent
# small-strain shear and bulk moduli.
MooneyRivlinCompressibleMat 1 d 0 C1 1923.076923076923 C2 0.0 K 8333.333333333334
DummyMat 2
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 values 3 0 0 0 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0 0 set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 2 dofs 1 3 values 1 -0.05 set 3
# This reduced case isolates a nonconforming-interface requirement using
# OOFEM's one-pass penalty contact on a small variable-thickness mesh.
structuralpenaltycontactbc 4 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 pn 1.e6 pt 1.e6 friction 0.0 mastersurface 1 slavesurface 2 nsd 3
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 0.0
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 npoints 2 t 2 0 1 f(t) 2 0 1
set 1 nodes 6 1 2 3 4 5 6
set 2 nodes 8 13 14 15 16 17 18 19 20
set 3 nodes 4 17 18 19 20
set 4 elements 2 4 5
set 5 elements 1 6
set 6 elements 3 1 2 3
